{"id":"651101","name":"西瓜果冻","author":"女将军令","authorId":"12461990","desc":"","cover":"images/651101/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"白凉粉","amount":"一包"},{"name":"西瓜","amount":"若干"}],"sub":[{"name":"白糖","amount":"少量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备白凉粉和西瓜、少量白糖。","img":"images/651101/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"把西瓜切成块状装盘。","img":"images/651101/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"清水400～～600ML烧热。","img":"images/651101/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"把白凉粉加入沸腾的水里，一个方向搅拌。","img":"images/651101/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"用锅铲一个方向搅拌。","img":"images/651101/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"把混有白凉粉的热水倒入盆中，加点白糖。","img":"images/651101/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"把西瓜倒入。","img":"images/651101/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放凉冷却。","img":"images/651101/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放凉冷却直到结冻。","img":"images/651101/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"西瓜🍉果冻出炉。","img":"images/651101/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"1.火候控制要得当。\n2.可依口味加白糖。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅、平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}